  "item": [
    {
      "name": "DEMS Simulation",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Start Full Simulation",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/send-to-dems/simulate",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["send-to-dems", "simulate"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tableNames\": [\"sim001\"]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Starts the full DEMS simulation - sends all messages from the specified table(s) to their respective DEMS endpoints one by one with proper time intervals.\n\nThis endpoint:\n- Accepts one or more simulation table names via the `tableNames` array\n- Fetches messages from all specified tables and processes them sequentially\n- Maintains original timing intervals between messages\n- Includes Bearer token authentication for each DEMS request\n- Targets different DEMS endpoints based on transaction type\n- Tracks delivery status for each message\n- Returns comprehensive simulation results\n\nRequest body:\n- `tableNames` (string[], required): Array of simulation table names (e.g. [\"sim001\"] or [\"sim001\", \"sim002\"])\n\nEach request to DEMS includes:\n- Bearer token authentication\n- Message ID and timestamp headers\n- Transaction payload\n- Proper content type headers"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Successful Simulation",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"tableNames\": [\"sim001\"]\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/send-to-dems/simulate",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["send-to-dems", "simulate"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
